from pathlib import Path
import json, collections
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
D=json.loads((R/'data/app-data.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
S=D['resources']['stage47']; A=S['daily_assignments']; C=S['catalog']
counts=collections.Counter(x['provider'] for x in A)
types=collections.Counter(x['resources']['writing']['task1']['type'] for x in D['resources']['days'])
# Master report
master=f'''# IELTS Boost — Stage 47 Master Report (Uzbek)\n\n**Release:** 47.0.0  \n**Sana:** 2026-11-08  \n**Maqsad:** 84 kunlik 4 skill resurslarini to‘liq ko‘rinadigan qilish, 84 ta Writing Task 1 visual datasetni chuqur o‘qitish va 84 kun uchun individual official Listening companion mapping.\n\n## 1. Yakuniy natija\n\n- **84/84 kun** bo‘yicha 4 ta majburiy skill kontenti ilova ichida saqlangan: **336/336 daily in-app resource slots**.\n- **84/84 Listening companion slot** aniq item title + official HTTPS URL bilan tuzilgan. Kundalik yo‘lda **28 ta noyob resource ID** qayta ishlatiladi; qayta tinglashda focus o‘zgaradi. To‘liq catalog’da **36 ta nomlangan resource** bor.\n- Kundalik companion provayder taqsimoti: TED-Ed **{counts['TED-Ed']}**, TED **{counts['TED']}**, Huberman Lab **{counts['Huberman Lab']}**, The Diary of a CEO **{counts['The Diary of a CEO']}**.\n- Joe Rogan Experience alohida optional discovery shelf’da; majburiy 84 kunlik yo‘lga qo‘yilmagan. Adult/explicit content xavfi sabab parent/teacher preview talab qilinadi.\n- Writing Task 1: 84 original fictional dataset, 6 tur × 14 ta: {', '.join(f'{k}={v}' for k,v in types.items())}.\n- 84 original Task 2 prompt, 84 kunlik Listening MP3/script/questions, 84 Reading passage/question set, 84 Speaking Part 1/2/3 set saqlandi.\n- 61 maqolalik kutubxona qo‘shimcha bo‘lib qoladi.\n\n## 2. 4 ta majburiy skill — in-app resurslar\n\n| Skill | Har bir kundagi asosiy resurs | Qo‘shimcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| Reading | Original passage + 10 savol + evidence/fact map | Official IELTS/weekly source links |\n| Listening | Original MP3 + original script + 5 savol + dictation chunk | Stage 47 individual video/podcast companion |\n| Writing | Original Task 1 visual + Task 1 prompt + Task 2 prompt | Task 1 Masterclass, four-criterion review, rewrite history |\n| Speaking | 3 Part 1 + Part 2 cue card + 3 Part 3 | Audio recording/replay, transcript field, self-review |\n\n`STAGE47_336_SKILL_RESOURCE_AUDIT_UZ.csv` har kuni har bir skill bo‘yicha primary material, supporting materials, output, source/rights va statusni ko‘rsatadi.\n\n## 3. Listening curation\n\n- 84 kunlik har bir slotda aniq item title, provider, URL, level estimate (editorial), listening focus, study task, caption/transcript status, age-suitability note, official embed/link mode, duration/segment note va internal fallback bor.\n- 28 unique item 84 slotda deliberate revisit bilan ishlatiladi; bir xil media qayta uchraganda boshqa tinglash maqsadi beriladi. Bu 84 ta turli video degani emas.\n- 36 item’lik catalog’da 28 daily-path item va qo‘shimcha/alternativ materiallar bor.\n- Huberman va DOAC uchun vaqt kodi faqat manbada tasdiqlangan segmentlarda ko‘rsatilgan; uzun podcastlarning to‘liq epizodi majburiy 5–8 daqiqalik resurs deb ko‘rsatilmaydi. Boshqa item’larda rasmiy playerning hozirgi davomiyligi tekshiriladi.\n- Caption/transcript mavjudligi o‘zgarishi mumkin; metadata “verify on official player” desa, bu mavjudligi mustaqil tasdiqlangan degani emas.\n- Har kungi internal audio/script/questions majburiy core bo‘lib qoladi. Tashqi companion optional extension.\n\n## 4. Task 1 — 84 ta original visual dataset\n\n| Visual turi | Dataset |\n|---|---:|\n| Line graph | 14 |\n| Bar chart | 14 |\n| Pie chart | 14 |\n| Table | 14 |\n| Process | 14 |\n| Map / redevelopment | 14 |\n| **Jami** | **84** |\n\nStage 47 quyidagilarni qo‘shdi:\n\n1. Oltita chart turi uchun alohida writing guide: to‘rt-paragraph tuzilma, qaysi ma’lumotni tanlash, mos til banki va keng tarqalgan xatolar.\n2. Visual data inspector: chart/table uchun barcha yorliq va seriyalar, pie uchun kategoriya+foiz, process uchun tartibli bosqichlar, map uchun before/after juftliklari.\n3. Deterministic data facts: min/max/range, trend, series comparisons, category average, pie share/percentage-point check, process start/end, map label changes.\n4. Data-derived overview model — ko‘chirib olish uchun emas, o‘z so‘zing bilan yozish uchun namuna.\n5. To‘rt qismli planner: overview, body 1, body 2, accuracy audit; shu qurilmada avtomatik saqlanadi.\n6. 150 so‘z minimum, odatda 4 qismli hisobot, opinion/reason/conclusion qo‘shmaslik eslatmasi.\n7. Dataset structural validator: prompt/title/source provenance/unit, labels/series lengths, numerical values, pie total=100, process stages and map pairing.\n\n**Muhim:** barcha 84 dataset original fictional practice; Barron’s, Cambridge yoki boshqa publisher chart/test/question ko‘chirilmagan. Bu IELTS-style practice, official test content emas. Structural checker data formatini tekshiradi; u yozilgan reportning semantik sifati, grammatika yoki IELTS bandini baholamaydi. Writing rubric va ustoz feedback alohida ishlaydi.\n\n## 5. Rights / use rules\n\n- Faqat provider’ning rasmiy sahifasiga havola; tashqi video/audio/transcript ilovaga yuklab olinmagan yoki qayta joylanmagan.\n- TED/TED-Ed sahifalari rasmiy link orqali ochiladi; TED materialini kesish, tahrirlash, transcriptni qayta nashr qilish yoki o‘z serveringda joylash yo‘q. Ayrim strukturali/commercial course use uchun alohida license talab bo‘lishi mumkin.\n- Podcast epizodlari provider/official YouTube sahifasida qoladi.\n- JRE faqat optional discovery va kattalar preview’idan keyin; compulsory path emas.\n- Barron’s grafiklarini ko‘chirib qo‘yish yo‘q; original ma’lumotlar yaratilgan.\n\n## 6. QA natijasi\n\n- Stage 47 static/data/HTTP QA: **40/40 PASS**.\n- Task 1 engine logic harness: **19/19 PASS** (84 day dataset validator, six visual fixtures, pie/process/map/series edge cases).\n- HTTP local-server smoke: **9/9 resources returned 200** (index, shell, JSON, app JS, Task1 module, Service Worker, audio day 1 and 84).\n- Regression suites: Stage 41 **21/21**, Stage 42 **23/23**, Stage 43 **39/39**, Stage 44 **30/30**, Stage 45 **33/33**, Stage 46 **47/47**.\n- ZIP SHA-256 va integrity check release paketini yig‘ishda qayta tekshiriladi.\n\n## 7. Pending / honesty notes\n\n- Full real-browser E2E va Samsung A14 acceptance (mic/ASR, PWA install, offline, backup/restore) bajarilmadi; bular Stage 50’da physical-device acceptance sifatida qoladi.\n- Tashqi provider playback/captions/duration vaqt o‘tishi bilan o‘zgarishi mumkin. Bu build rasmiy URL va metadata beradi; playerdagi hozirgi holatni foydalanuvchi ochganda tekshirish zarur.\n- CEFR level — editorial estimate; provider tomonidan sertifikatlangan CEFR daraja emas.\n- IELTS Boost 0–10 natijalari practice index; rasmiy IELTS band emas.\n- JRE materiallari adult preview talab qiladi va kundalik majburiy path’da yo‘q.\n'''
(R/'STAGE47_MASTER_REPORT_UZ.md').write_text(master,encoding='utf-8')
# Task 1 guide
task1='''# Stage 47 — Academic Writing Task 1 Masterclass\n\n## Maqsad\n\nTask 1 da chartni ko‘chirib tasvirlash emas, eng muhim xususiyatlarni tanlash, umumiy manzarani to‘g‘ri ko‘rsatish, raqamlarni xatosiz solishtirish va 150+ so‘zli aniq report yozish o‘rgatiladi. Kunlik limit yo‘q.\n\n## Universal report structure\n\n1. **Introduction:** chart/map/process nimani ko‘rsatishini o‘z so‘zing bilan qayta yoz; birlik, mavzu va vaqt oralig‘ini yo‘qotma.\n2. **Overview:** eng katta 1–2 xususiyat yoki jarayonning umumiy yo‘nalishini ayt. Raqamlarni ko‘paytirib yuborma; sabab, fikr yoki tavsiya kiritma.\n3. **Body 1:** birinchi mantiqiy guruh — masalan, eng yuqori/eng past, birinchi davr, dominant ulush, jarayonning dastlabki bosqichlari yoki sharqiy/g‘arbiy hudud.\n4. **Body 2:** qolgan muhim taqqoslashlar, keyingi bosqichlar yoki qolgan hudud. Har bir raqamni visual bilan qayta tekshir.\n\nKamida 150 so‘z. Odatda alohida conclusion kerak emas. Task 1 — data report; Task 2 kabi fikr bildirish yoki sabab taxmin qilish vazifasi emas.\n\n## 6 visual turi bo‘yicha maxsus strategiya\n\n### 1. Line graph\n- X/Y o‘qi, birlik, vaqt davri va har bir series nomini tekshir.\n- Boshlanish va yakun, peak/trough, eng katta o‘sish/pasayish va turning pointlarni top.\n- Overview’da umumiy yo‘nalish va seriyalar bir-biriga yaqinlashganmi yoki ajralganmi — ayt.\n- Body’da davrlarni guruhla; har bir yilni bittalab yozma.\n- *rose, declined, fluctuated, remained stable, peaked at, ended at* kabi aniq fe’llar.\n- Percentage change va percentage-point farqini chalkashtirma.\n\n### 2. Bar chart\n- Kategoriya, series/legend, birlik va scale’ni o‘qi.\n- Eng yuqori/past kategoriyalar, guruhlar oralig‘idagi farq, yaqin qiymatlar va ranking o‘zgarishini qidir.\n- Agar grouped bars bo‘lsa, bir kategoriya ichida group’larni solishtir; butun chart bo‘yicha max/min ni ham tekshir.\n- *accounted for, exceeded, was below, by a margin of, approximately twice as high* — faqat sonlar asos bersa.\n\n### 3. Pie chart\n- Umumiy ulush 100% ekanini tekshir.\n- Dominant, eng kichik va birga guruhlashga arziydigan qismlarni tanla.\n- “Percentage” bilan “percentage points” farqini saqla. Bitta pie bo‘lsa, vaqt o‘tishi bilan oshdi/pasaydi deb yozma.\n\n### 4. Table\n- Qator va ustun sarlavhalari, birlik, footnote va davrni o‘qi.\n- Eng katta/kichik qiymatlarni va har bir qator/ustun ichidagi patternni qidir.\n- O‘xshash qiymatlarni guruhla; katakma-katak takrorlama.\n- “respectively” faqat tartib bir ma’noli bo‘lsa ishlatiladi.\n\n### 5. Process diagram\n- Boshlanish, yakun va jami bosqichlarni aniqlang.\n- Bosqichlarni original tartibda guruhla.\n- Passive voice ko‘pincha mos: *is collected, is transferred, is processed*.\n- Rasmda ko‘rsatilmagan sabab, maqsad yoki actorni o‘ylab topma.\n- Jarayon siklik bo‘lmasa, cycle deb atama.\n\n### 6. Maps / redevelopment plans\n- Sana/plan, compass/north arrow, asosiy reference pointlarni top.\n- Added, removed, relocated, expanded, converted va unchanged elementlarni ajrat.\n- Body’ni hudud yoki o‘zgarish turi bo‘yicha guruhla.\n- North arrow ko‘rsatilmagan bo‘lsa, north/south deb taxmin qilma. Diagramma scale bermasa masofa o‘ylab topma.\n\n## Stage 47 ilovadagi vositalar\n\n- **Data inspector:** line/bar/table uchun category+series jadvali; pie uchun category+share; process uchun raqamlangan bosqichlar; map uchun before→after juftlik.\n- **Facts engine:** min/max/range, series movement, category average/gap, pie sum, process count/start/end, map change summary.\n- **Overview example:** ma’lumotdan generatsiya qilingan model. Uni qayta yoz; u tayyor javob yoki band 9 sample deb da’vo qilinmaydi.\n- **Planning board:** overview, body paragraph 1, body paragraph 2, accuracy audit. Avtomatik saqlanadi.\n- **Plan structure checker:** to‘rt maydonda yetarli reja matni borligini tekshiradi; grammar, relevance, coherence yoki IELTS bandni baholamaydi.\n- **Existing Writing lab:** Task 1 draft, word count (150 minimum), precision audit, four-criterion self-review, reviewer/teacher feedback va rewrite history.\n\n## Dataset integrity\n\n84 ta Task 1 dataset original fictional practice. Har bir visual turi 14 martadan. Stage 47 validator title/prompt/unit/source type, labels, series alignment, numeric values, pie total, process steps va map pairing’ni tekshiradi. Barcha 84 dataset struktura validatsiyasidan o‘tdi.\n\nBu validator **writing semantic marker emas**. U ma’lumot tuzilmasi va arifmetik consistency’ni tekshiradi; learner yozgan reportning relevance, grammar, vocabulary va examiner bandini to‘liq tekshirmaydi.\n'''
(R/'STAGE47_TASK1_MASTERCLASS_UZ.md').write_text(task1,encoding='utf-8')
# Listening curation catalogue
lines=['# Stage 47 — Listening Curation Register','', '**Kundalik yo‘l:** 84 assignment; **28 noyob resource ID** 84 sessiyada turli tinglash focus’lari bilan qayta ishlatiladi. **Catalog:** 36 individual nomlangan item. External companion majburiy audio o‘rnini bosmaydi — 84 ta local MP3/script/5 savol core bo‘lib qoladi.','',f"## Daily provider distribution\n\n"+'\n'.join(f'- {p}: {n} daily slots' for p,n in counts.items()),'', '## Catalog (individual official pages)','']
for x in C:
    lines.append(f"- **{x['title']}** — {x['provider']} · [official page]({x['url']}) · {x.get('level','—')} editorial estimate. {x.get('task','')}")
lines += ['', '## Joe Rogan — optional discovery only','', 'Joe Rogan Experience is listed separately as optional discovery. The platform does not make this a compulsory session; the episode must be reviewed by a parent/teacher for content suitability before use. It is not counted in the 84-day companion distribution.', '', '## Metadata and fallback','', '- Each daily row includes the precise title, URL, provider, level estimate and its basis, duration/segment note, listening focus, study task, transcript/caption status, suitability, link mode and last-checked date.', '- CEFR labels are editorial estimates, not official certifications.', '- If an external video is unavailable, use the in-app day audio, script, dictation chunk and five questions. Do not skip the compulsory core.', '- Long-form podcast episodes are optional extensions. A timecode is listed only where it has been verified; otherwise follow the official player and its current duration.', '- Repeats deliberately target different skills: gist, signposting, evidence/example, cause/effect, speaker stance/paraphrase and summary/vocabulary.', '', 'See `STAGE47_RESOURCE_MAPPING_UZ.csv` for all 84 day assignments and `STAGE47_336_SKILL_RESOURCE_AUDIT_UZ.csv` for the full four-skill resource inventory.']
(R/'STAGE47_LISTENING_CURATION_UZ.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
# Rights policy / update register
rights='''# Stage 47 — Resource Rights & Safety Policy\n\n## Core rule\n\nIELTS Boost stores only original learner-practice material (84 synthetic-voice MP3s/scripts, fictional Task 1 datasets, and original prompts) in its local project. External TED/TED-Ed/podcast audio/video/transcripts are not downloaded, edited, cut, copied into the bundle or rehosted. The platform opens the provider’s own official page.\n\n## TED\n\n- Use the official TED talk page/player and provide attribution/title/link.\n- Do not edit, shorten, clip, download, re-upload or republish full transcript text as app-owned content.\n- TED’s published terms distinguish personal/non-commercial use from commercial or organised educational/course use; some structured curriculum use can require a licence. If distribution context changes, seek rights-holder permission before expanding beyond official link use.\n\n## TED-Ed\n\n- TED-Ed videos are copyrighted unless a separate licence states otherwise.\n- Link to the official TED-Ed lesson or standard official YouTube player/embed where the owner allows it.\n- Do not download, edit, trim, subtitle, or re-upload the video.\n\n## Podcasts / YouTube\n\n- Huberman Lab, The Diary of a CEO, and Joe Rogan Experience remain on official provider/official YouTube pages. No podcast MP3s or captions are bundled.\n- Current video playback, caption availability, embed permission and age restrictions depend on the provider/platform and can change.\n- Huberman health/science material is used as English listening content, not individual medical advice.\n- The Diary of a CEO and Joe Rogan are long-form interview shows; an item’s topic and exact segment must be screened before any compulsory use.\n\n## Age suitability\n\n- Joe Rogan Experience is optional discovery only and requires parent/teacher preview. It is not in the mandatory 84-day schedule.\n- Where an episode has adult themes or its complete contents have not been reviewed, the platform must not label it age-safe or compulsory.\n\n## Barron’s and other publisher material\n\n- Do not reproduce Barron’s charts, page layouts, question text, answer keys, scans or paid audio.\n- Task 1 visuals in this project are original fictional datasets built to practise the same IELTS visual families.\n- The 61-article library remains supplementary; any future public distribution must independently verify the article’s copyright and terms.\n\n## Official reference pages\n\n- TED usage policy: https://www.ted.com/about/our-organization/our-policies-terms/ted-talks-usage-policy\n- TED-Ed FAQ: https://support.ed.ted.com/hc/en-us/articles/360042869173-Can-I-download-or-re-upload-TED-Ed-videos\n- YouTube embed help: https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/171780\n- Huberman Lab: https://www.hubermanlab.com/podcast\n- The Diary of a CEO: https://stevenbartlett.com/doac/\n- Joe Rogan Experience official YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@PowerfulJRE\n'''
(R/'STAGE47_RESOURCE_RIGHTS_POLICY_UZ.md').write_text(rights,encoding='utf-8')
# Release notes
notes='''# IELTS Boost — Stage 47 Release Notes\n\n## Delivered\n\n- Stage 47 Resource Integration & Verification complete.\n- 84 daily external Listening companion links with metadata and fallback.\n- Curated catalog: 36 resources; daily path: 28 unique items across 84 slots.\n- Four compulsory skill resources surfaced on every day (336 slots).\n- New 336-row resource audit and 84-row Listening mapping.\n- 84 original Task 1 data visual datasets structurally validated, 6 types × 14.\n- Task 1 masterclass and six-type guide; exact data inspector; fact summary; overview prompt; plan board and structure-only validation.\n- Preserved all 84 local MP3 tracks, scripts and 420 questions.\n- Preserved Task 2 prompts, Speaking prompts, and 61 supplementary articles.\n- New Task 1 visual analysis module and Stage 47 CSS are included in Service Worker precache; legacy audio cache preserved.\n\n## QA\n\n- Stage 47 suite: 40/40 PASS.\n- Task 1 logic: 19/19 PASS.\n- HTTP smoke: 9/9 HTTP 200.\n- Historical regression suites: Stage 41 21/21; 42 23/23; 43 39/39; 44 30/30; 45 33/33; 46 47/47.\n\n## Known limitations\n\n- No real-browser E2E / Samsung A14 physical-device acceptance in this environment.\n- External video play/captions may change; the official player remains authoritative.\n- Joe Rogan remains optional preview-only.\n- Level labels are editorial estimates.\n- Task 1 engine validates dataset structure and derives facts; it is not a semantic essay marker and does not produce IELTS band scores.\n- Generative AI feedback backend is not included by this stage.\n'''
